WEBVTT

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.440
Who is that? Who? Who?

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:14.510
DEVILMAN

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:21.990
This man took on the name "traitor"
He threw away everything to fight

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:25.720
His Devil Arrow is a supersonic wave
His Devil Ears can hear anything

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:29.390
His Devil Wing lets him fly through the air
His Devil Beam is a ray of heat

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:36.370
With the power of a devil inside him

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:45.240
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:56.390
This man first learned of human love
That kindness awakened him

00:00:56.690 --> 00:01:00.600
His Devil Chop has punching power
His Devil Kick has destructive power

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:04.260
His Devil Eye has X-ray power
His Devil Cutter can break through rocks

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:11.410
With the power of a devil inside him

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:20.280
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:01:37.190 --> 00:01:42.190
I hate Devilman, but what I truly
cannot stand is Lala's betrayal.

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:44.840
Traitors must be punished.

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:52.650
I must have her executed.
But who should do it?

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:58.450
With this scepter,
I summon Kilskey!

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:08.260
DEMON KILSKEY
THE CRIMSON TORNADO

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:13.500
Did you summon me?

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:18.730
Dear me.

00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:20.500
Sobriety makes you weak.

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:24.470
Well, I am very old, you know.

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:29.120
Very well. Drink this
monstrous Stardust Cocktail.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.750
I am indeed honored.

00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:39.990
That should do.

00:03:02.810 --> 00:03:05.610
How delicious.
Well, Demon Marshal.

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:08.680
What can your humble servant
Kilskey do for you?

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:11.390
I am turning the condemned
criminal Lala over to you.

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:14.360
Lala?

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:18.500
That crooked woman?

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:23.060
Are you up to the task, Kilskey?

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:25.380
Devilman is on Lala's side.

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:31.920
Shut up! You doubt the capable Kilskey?!

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:45.290
They will die in the blink of an eye.

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:47.730
With care and elegance!

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.110
What?!

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:23.190
The human world is far more
frightening than the demons'!

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:49.760
NAKADO ACADEMY

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:53.220
This must be it.

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.500
I look forward to Lala's arrival!

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:29.780
I was up pulling an all-nighter.

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:32.490
And this lush just got to
sit and drink all night.

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:34.400
It's not fair!

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:38.600
Hey, you twins!

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:42.530
Twins? Huh?
Are you talking to me?

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:51.210
Yeah, I'm talkin’ to ya!

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:54.420
Stay in one place!

00:06:56.280 --> 00:06:58.260
You're one person, after all.

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:01.280
Is Akira Fudo a student
at this school?

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:02.750
That's right!

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:06.250
Do you know of a girl
who stays close to him?

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:09.120
You must mean Lala!

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:11.330
That would be her.

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:12.830
When will she get here?

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:16.360
Not today.
It's a holiday.

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:18.600
Why you!

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:20.010
Stop it!

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:27.780
I'm ticklish! Please stop!

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:29.780
Don't lie to me!

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:31.210
I'm not lying!

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:36.090
We have the day off to prepare for the
school's anniversary party tomorrow!

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:40.230
School anniversary?

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:52.330
She's off playing.

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:54.700
- Where?
- No idea.

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:55.940
Go away and find her!

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:59.870
CHACO

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:01.440
Welcome.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:02.740
Not here.

00:08:02.740 --> 00:08:03.050
CHACO

00:08:04.510 --> 00:08:05.390
What?

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:09.120
Not here.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:24.070
Lala, where are you?

00:08:29.670 --> 00:08:31.580
Here I go! Check this out!

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:55.340
Too easy.

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:57.230
That's amazing, Akira!

00:08:57.230 --> 00:08:59.370
I'll bet you could play in the majors!

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:01.340
You could work in
the circus pan time!

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:02.940
Yeah, I guess...

00:09:02.940 --> 00:09:07.070
This is nothing impressive.
Akira's just showing off for me.

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:09.350
You can do better Lala?

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:11.450
You bet.

00:09:11.510 --> 00:09:14.890
Demons are different from
humans, so I should be able to.

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:17.660
It's my turn!

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:26.860
Here I go! Watch this!

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:35.440
No good. Time to
play my trump card!

00:09:37.270 --> 00:09:39.370
That sure is a wide bat.

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:41.380
Somethings wrong with my eyes!

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:43.380
Am I getting nearsighted?

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:44.620
That idiot.

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:46.790
There!

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:18.450
Sorry...

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:22.750
You're Demon Kilskey!

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:25.250
Lala's right over there...

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:28.130
I know!

00:10:42.440 --> 00:10:43.640
What should I do?

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:48.950
Lala, look out!

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:58.030
What's going on?!

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:04.860
Lala!

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:11.810
DEVIL!

00:11:16.370 --> 00:11:17.580
Devil Wing!

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:31.020
It's melting through my body!

00:11:34.490 --> 00:11:35.490
Dammit!

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:57.080
Akira!

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:00.820
Hang on, Akira!

00:12:13.230 --> 00:12:14.800
I'm going home!

00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:19.870
What do you plan on doing
with me, you pervert?!

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:23.580
I was just thinking about
what I should do!

00:12:24.240 --> 00:12:27.570
Shall I cut off your fat
radish-like legs and pickle them?

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:30.560
Or shall I squeeze the
blood from them first?

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:38.390
If I must die, I want
to die artistically!

00:12:38.390 --> 00:12:39.520
How about curry rice?

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:41.360
I want to die romantically!

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:42.990
Let me see Devilman!

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:46.590
- Devilman?
- Since he loves me so very, very much!

00:12:46.590 --> 00:12:50.130
If I meet a violent end,
it will make him so sad!

00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:52.700
This is the first I've
heard of such a thing.

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:58.010
I see, Devilman loves you?
Very well.

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:02.810
I'll do you this favor
and bring him here.

00:13:02.810 --> 00:13:06.350
Kilsey, thank you!
I love you!

00:13:06.350 --> 00:13:10.450
I shall beat this fool of a
girl in front of Devilman!

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:27.000
My back still hurts.

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:30.610
Dammit! I want to help Lala, but
that red stuff messed me up!

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:41.390
Lala, are you still alive?

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:44.050
Devilman...

00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:48.390
Help»-

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:49.530
Lala!

00:14:09.940 --> 00:14:11.820
Damn!

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:28.260
“If you want Lala back, come
to the school at sunrise.“

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:30.730
All right!

00:14:41.180 --> 00:14:44.710
Sis! Akira drove off looking all angry!

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:45.820
I'm in here!

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:55.860
NAKADO ACADEMY
7 MONTH ANNIVERSARY
PARTY LOCATION

00:14:55.860 --> 00:14:59.990
With this, I officially
conclude tonight's party.

00:14:59.990 --> 00:15:01.300
Ahem.

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:09.000
Well, that's the end of
the overnight rehearsal.

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:10.100
- Wait!
- Huh?

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:14.080
I still don't like it, so I'm
revising the statements again.

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:18.020
No matter how many times you
tn/ it, it'll still be awful!

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:23.120
7TH MONTH

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:26.650
What?!

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:27.930
What the hell?!

00:15:40.570 --> 00:15:44.980
We're blessed with such
fine weather today...

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:18.380
DEVIL!

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:22.340
You've arrived, Devilman.

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:23.580
Where's Lala?

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.220
Over there.

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:36.170
Devilman!
You came to rescue me!

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:41.000
Lala, don't move!

00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:53.720
Devil Wing!

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:09.530
Devilman, hang in there!
You can't lose!

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:14.170
Oh no!

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:19.210
Devil Beam!

00:17:25.340 --> 00:17:26.370
Blast!

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:42.730
You're trapped now.

00:17:43.360 --> 00:17:44.760
Damn!

00:17:44.760 --> 00:17:47.060
You should not have to die alone.

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:49.100
I'll let you die
watching your friend.

00:17:50.060 --> 00:17:52.740
Devilman, hang in there!

00:17:57.640 --> 00:17:59.570
Die, Devilman!

00:17:59.570 --> 00:18:02.850
You will wither and die
in my red chamber of death!

00:18:17.560 --> 00:18:19.600
Devil Beam!

00:18:25.070 --> 00:18:26.410
Devil Cutter!

00:18:29.240 --> 00:18:30.720
Devil Arrow!

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:18.690
My cocktail!

00:19:18.690 --> 00:19:23.930
Keep off! Keep your
feet off! Keep off!

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:25.830
Wait! Wait!

00:19:27.360 --> 00:19:31.260
I'm powerless without that drink!

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:32.640
Help!

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:39.810
All right, I'll spare you.
Now get lost!

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:42.090
Oh dear!

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:48.350
Kilskey!

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:52.200
I was defeated.
My age betrayed me.

00:19:58.660 --> 00:20:01.330
- Over there!
- Akira!

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:09.100
Honestly!

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:11.080
My bad!

00:20:12.110 --> 00:20:16.610
Many things have happened
during these seven months.

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:20.110
Appreciating our good fortune
at still being alive...

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:23.580
I now announce the end of today's party!

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:30.500
7 MONTH

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:49.840
No one knows; no one may know

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:56.580
Who Devilman really is

00:20:57.420 --> 00:21:04.230
No one speaks; no one may say

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:10.080
Who Devilman really is

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:14.000
In the world of man, there is love

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:17.200
In the world of man, there are dreams

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:22.200
Wanting only to protect
these beautiful things,

00:21:24.350 --> 00:21:33.090
Devilman is off, somewhere, today

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:53.120
No one knows; no one may know

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:59.320
Where Devilman comes from

00:21:59.810 --> 00:22:04.810
No one speaks; no one may say

00:22:06.920 --> 00:22:11.920
Where Devilman comes from

00:22:13.360 --> 00:22:16.700
For he can never go home again

00:22:16.700 --> 00:22:19.700
He wanders on a journey

00:22:19.700 --> 00:22:26.380
Now that he understands peace

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:36.520
He'll be Devilman again,
somewhere, tomorrow

00:22:56.270 --> 00:22:58.980
You are Lala's friend, correct?

00:22:59.470 --> 00:23:01.970
Lala has betrayed our Demon Tribe!

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:03.240
I'm aware.

00:23:03.240 --> 00:23:06.480
She has allied herself with Devilman!

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:10.080
Lala is far beyond despicable!
Kill her!

00:23:10.080 --> 00:23:12.030
Kill Lala!

00:23:17.820 --> 00:23:20.060
Angry over Lala's betrayal,

00:23:20.060 --> 00:23:23.600
the Demon Marshal sends Lala's best
friend, Aurora, to the human world.

00:23:23.600 --> 00:23:26.530
Aurora, I've been dying to see you!

00:23:26.530 --> 00:23:27.710
As have I.

00:23:31.000 --> 00:23:33.710
Devilman, I loathe you!

00:23:40.550 --> 00:23:42.050
MY eyes hurt!

00:23:46.950 --> 00:23:49.990
Aurora, angry at Lala for
not doing as she says,

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:51.790
drags Lala high into the sky.

00:23:51.790 --> 00:23:53.460
Help me!

00:23:53.460 --> 00:23:55.200
Lala fights back hard.

00:23:56.900 --> 00:23:59.800
Take this! Prepare to die!

00:23:59.800 --> 00:24:02.870
Sparks fly between the best
friends Lala and Aurora

00:24:02.870 --> 00:24:04.850
as they try to get the
upper hand on each other.

00:24:08.940 --> 00:24:11.120
AURORA!

00:24:17.080 --> 00:24:21.150
Aurora transforms, and drops
the Hell Curtain on Lala.

00:24:21.150 --> 00:24:23.760
Let me out of here!

00:24:24.260 --> 00:24:29.040
Aurora's curtain, flickering with eerie
light, attacks humans one after another.

00:24:31.830 --> 00:24:35.030
Devilman fights back viciously
against Aurora's schemes.

00:24:35.040 --> 00:24:38.200
But Aurora's attacks continue!

00:24:38.210 --> 00:24:39.840
Devilman is in peril!

00:24:39.840 --> 00:24:41.140
Next time on Devilman:

00:24:41.140 --> 00:24:44.590
DEMON AURORA
THE SPARKLING PRISON
